            "1756978566601a002564": {
              "type": "$rich-text",
              "settings": {
                "content": "\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eWe believe every child is a natural explorer. From muddy soccer fields to running under the sun, our children's sportswear draws inspiration from these innocent moments. Founded in 2024, Mudjean is dedicated to providing durable, comfortable, and stylish athletic gear for kids aged 2-14, using high-performance fabrics like bird's eye mesh polyester to ensure they can play freely without restrictions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eOur mission: Make sports fun, not a burden. Through sustainable materials and innovative designs, we help parents choose reliable companions for their children. Whether it's a family soccer game or daily activities, Mudjean accompanies every step of growth—because joy starts from the mud!\u003c/p\u003e"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
